          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: संकट",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संकट — saṅkaṭ — \"a crisis\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर बारिश नहीं होगी तो किसानों पर संकट आएगा। agar bāriś nahīṃ hogī to kisānoṁ par saṅkaṭ āegā. If it doesn't rain, the farmers will face a crisis."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संकट (saṅkaṭ) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit saṃkaṭa, \"narrow; dangerous, critical\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
